  "solution": {
    "text": "Observations : $2,3,5,8,12$\nMean $=\\frac{2+3+5+8+12}{5}=6$\n$\\therefore \\sigma^2=13.2$\nMedian $=5=m$\n$\\therefore \\quad$ Mean deviation about median\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{\\Sigma\\left|x_i-m\\right|}{n}=\\frac{3+2+0+3+7}{5}=3$\n$M=3 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2-M=13.2-3=10.2$",
